<title>UK: Amvestors sets $160 million January 2007 FRN.</title>
<headline>Amvestors sets $160 million January 2007 FRN.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, 21 November 1996 - The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AMVESTORS, CBO TRUST CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $160 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    20.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     99.688    PAY DATE  L-05.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.688    FULL FEES   0.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.688    AVE LIFE    7.9 YRS</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.30	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
